ALBUKHR STAKING CONTRACT V2 — ADMIN UI

Placement
---------
- admin-staking-contract-v2.html -> repository root
- admin-dashboard.js -> repository root/js path exactly as the existing script location

The dashboard JS adds the Staking Contract V2 administration module with the same role model as the secured Supabase publication workspace.

Security
--------
- Mainnet only
- AAL2 required by the existing admin auth/security layer
- Reads get_core_staking_contract_workspace()
- Publishes only through publish_core_staking_term_version()
- No direct table writes from browser
- No automatic publication
- Publishing a term does not activate a project
- The 1% global ALBUKHR transaction fee remains read-only and authoritative in the database

